{I'm delighted to invite you to our school's upcoming "The Future is Here" tech festival, which will be held next Friday from 2 p.m. to 5 p.m. in the school auditorium.

The event will feature a series of exciting activities. First, we will have a keynote speech by a tech expert on cutting-edge technologies like AI and smart cities. Then, there will be a student innovation exhibition, where you can see our homemade tech projects, such as AI-assisted learning tools and smart home devices. Finally, we'll hold a hands-on workshop, allowing you to experience UK technology and interact with the latest products.

I know you have a great passion for technology, so this event is perfect for you. It will not only broaden your horizons but also give you a chance to communicate with like-minded students. I hope you can join us! I'm looking forward to your reply.}
